# playpick gave mode=battleground map=flags spec=mage:frost style=flee
# view=844x390,touch save=carried. Two firsts checked against the ledger and
# every .play under playtest/plans/ before committing to this script: no prior
# battleground session has ever run mage:frost (all six frost/fire/arcane-less
# priors were priest:shadow, hunter:marksmanship, shaman:elemental, druid:feral,
# warlock:destruction, druid:balance -- no mage at all), and `flee` -- which
# direction.md's [[#7]] already has losing outright on conquest (The Three
# Cairns, 2026-09-24) -- has never been paired with this specific map (flags,
# Ebb and Flow). Every flags-map session on record so far used auto, melee or
# a bare-idle control, never a style that runs from everything and never
# fights. #278 already covers this map's real 180s limit vs README's claimed
# 360s, so the chunks below sum past 180s on purpose to watch the match
# actually end rather than re-measuring that gap.
open
targets
shot front

tap battleground
tap map:flags
targets
shot flags-picked

tap class:mage:frost
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
shot pulled
state
targets

play flee 60
shot mid1
state
bill
says

wait 5
play flee 60
shot mid2
state
bill

wait 5
play flee 70
shot mid3
state
bill
says
targets
